{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Deprived of Color</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a village where no one can possess color, a child named \u2018Fade\u2019 was born with the unique ability to manipulate color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to reclaim the lost colors and seek vengeance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulwander is a pixel-graphic 2D action roguelike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through side-scrolling stages, dodging relentless enemy attacks and breaking through using powerful weapons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/d195d648a920f3621b5180869b308ca2.avif?t=1759198371\" data-has-big width=1560 height=628 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Weapons and Styles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose two from the initial five weapon types to build your unique playstyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon possesses an enhancement that transforms its form, changing its normal attacks and skills into entirely different styles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, you can infuse souls into weapons to enhance their stats, giving you an advantage in battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/d0a594583980867e2bb85faefb2ceed9.avif?t=1759198371\" data-has-big width=1560 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Themes and Enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five distinct regions exist, each inhabited by unique races. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fierce wolf tribe dwells in the cold snowfields, a deer tribe in the tranquil forest, a shark tribe in the stormy seas, a serpent tribe in the scorching desert, and a fox tribe in the enchanted castle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face over 40 types of common enemies, over 10 types of elite enemies, and powerful bosses to survive in this faded world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/eb3902e660099bd078d1a4ceea53c9fd.poster.avif?t=1759198371\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/eb3902e660099bd078d1a4ceea53c9fd.webm?t=1759198371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/eb3902e660099bd078d1a4ceea53c9fd.mp4?t=1759198371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/5b50a87f7c2c8f1602269a719aa66774.poster.avif?t=1759198371\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/5b50a87f7c2c8f1602269a719aa66774.webm?t=1759198371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/5b50a87f7c2c8f1602269a719aa66774.mp4?t=1759198371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constant Threats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will relentlessly swarm you, with increasingly powerful foes threatening your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly eliminate enemies to harvest their souls, nurturing the Tree of Light on the battlefield to gather colored fruits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting these fruits grants you powerful artifacts imbued with potent effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/202e7dbb5e56062563f011f0537afaa6.poster.avif?t=1759198371\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/202e7dbb5e56062563f011f0537afaa6.webm?t=1759198371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/202e7dbb5e56062563f011f0537afaa6.mp4?t=1759198371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final Challenge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you've cleared all stages, the leader of one race will appear to mark the end of the chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike regular enemies, the leader possesses more lethal attacks and formidable vitality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test the strength you've built up so far, defeat the leader, and claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/53ca043ffccecd938798adc7fa580d4b.poster.avif?t=1759198371\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/53ca043ffccecd938798adc7fa580d4b.webm?t=1759198371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/53ca043ffccecd938798adc7fa580d4b.mp4?t=1759198371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3224280?t=1759198371","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759198371","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/d617ba787ff2f0c5fe364267145bebc606dd10fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759198371","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/d617ba787ff2f0c5fe364267145bebc606dd10fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759198371","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3545980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Deprived of Color</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a village where no one can possess color, a child named \u2018Fade\u2019 was born with the unique ability to manipulate color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to reclaim the lost colors and seek vengeance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulwander is a pixel-graphic 2D action roguelike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through side-scrolling stages, dodging relentless enemy attacks and breaking through using powerful weapons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/d195d648a920f3621b5180869b308ca2.avif?t=1759198371\" data-has-big width=1560 height=628 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Weapons and Styles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose two from the initial five weapon types to build your unique playstyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon possesses an enhancement that transforms its form, changing its normal attacks and skills into entirely different styles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, you can infuse souls into weapons to enhance their stats, giving you an advantage in battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/d0a594583980867e2bb85faefb2ceed9.avif?t=1759198371\" data-has-big width=1560 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Themes and Enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five distinct regions exist, each inhabited by unique races. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fierce wolf tribe dwells in the cold snowfields, a deer tribe in the tranquil forest, a shark tribe in the stormy seas, a serpent tribe in the scorching desert, and a fox tribe in the enchanted castle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face over 40 types of common enemies, over 10 types of elite enemies, and powerful bosses to survive in this faded world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/eb3902e660099bd078d1a4ceea53c9fd.poster.avif?t=1759198371\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/eb3902e660099bd078d1a4ceea53c9fd.webm?t=1759198371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/eb3902e660099bd078d1a4ceea53c9fd.mp4?t=1759198371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img