er of one race will appear to mark the end of the chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike regular enemies, the leader possesses more lethal attacks and formidable vitality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test the strength you've built up so far, defeat the leader, and claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/53ca043ffccecd938798adc7fa580d4b.poster.avif?t=1759198371\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/53ca043ffccecd938798adc7fa580d4b.webm?t=1759198371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/53ca043ffccecd938798adc7fa580d4b.mp4?t=1759198371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["MYMEStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/header.jpg?t=1759198371","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3224280/191084364/aaab7369fdeff864cd3762bf76c2ed4a05291a4f/1755734103/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755736956","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3224280/191084364/aaab7369fdeff864cd3762bf76c2ed4a05291a4f/1755734103/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755736956","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3224280/191084364/aaab7369fdeff864cd3762bf76c2ed4a05291a4f/1755734103/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755736956","id":257186